# app-ads.txt TEMPLATE - NOT LIVE. Do not rename this to app-ads.txt yet.
#
# WHY IT IS A TEMPLATE
# An app-ads.txt file that exists but lists no valid seller tells every ad
# exchange "nobody is authorised to sell my inventory", which BLOCKS ad
# serving. A MISSING file is the neutral state. Publishing an empty one is
# therefore strictly worse than publishing none, and the failure is silent -
# you would see zero fill and no error.
#
# WHEN TO ACTIVATE
# After the Google Ad Manager / AdSense account exists and has issued a
# publisher ID (tracked as the ad go-live epic, OpenProject #3630). Then:
#   1. Replace pub-0000000000000000 below with the real publisher ID.
#   2. Rename this file to  app-ads.txt  at the REPO ROOT.
#   3. Confirm it is reachable at https://dumoleb.github.io/app-ads.txt
#   4. Make sure the Play listing's "Website" field points at this domain -
#      crawlers read the store listing to find the site, then fetch
#      /app-ads.txt from its ROOT. That is why this site is a user site
#      (dumoleb.github.io) and not a project site.
#   5. Allow up to 24h for the crawler to pick it up.
#
